  Slug: fireworks-performer
  DisplayName: Fireworks Performer
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Few celebrations in Tian Xia are complete without a show of fireworks,
    and your job is to make sure they go off without a hitch. You load the fireworks,
    set the fuses, and choreograph the performance, bringing the show together in
    a finale of lights and explosions. Then it's time to pack up your gear and move
    on to the next civic holiday or religious festival. Of course, someone who travels
    the roads with a pack full of high explosives is bound to run into an adventure
    or two along the way, and so over time, your fireworks have been spent in support
    of that life. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Charisma
    , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Performance skill
    and the Fireworks Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Fascinating
    Performance] skill feat.
